From: Jason Rhinelander <jason@imaginary.ca>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:56:53 -0400
Subject: Include ngtcp2.h for NGTCP2_ERR_HANDSHAKE_TIMEOUT

The onion request router compares close codes against ngtcp2's
handshake timeout error, which only compiled while something else
happened to pull in ngtcp2's header.
---
 src/network/routing/onion_request_router.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/network/routing/onion_request_router.cpp b/src/network/routing/onion_request_router.cpp
index 0c379b1..0033828 100644
--- a/src/network/routing/onion_request_router.cpp
+++ b/src/network/routing/onion_request_router.cpp
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 #include <event2/event.h>
 #include <fmt/ranges.h>
+#include <ngtcp2/ngtcp2.h>
 
 #include <chrono>
 #include <exception>
